	(descr "Lumberg 1502 07, 3.5mm stereo (TRS) jack, vertical/upright, THT, no switch, plain Ø6 x 3mm bushing (no thread, no nut), body 6 x 8 x 11.5mm above PCB, Ø1.2 locating peg. Drawn from Lumberg datasheet 1502_07 (07/2025) and the Lumberg STEP; solder eyes 1.2 x 0.3 through the board, slots 1.5 x 0.8 per sheet. Origin = plug axis. Lumberg pins: 2=S, 4=T, 3=R (T/R inferred from Lumberg's schematic symbol style — verify). Farnell 4218066.")
